  "body": "What happens: cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings fails at crates/app/src/operation/heights.rs:128. Clippy 1.99 reports needless_borrows_for_generic_args on `.map(&resolve)`.\nExpected: The clippy step of the batch gate passes on current stable toolchains.\nEvidence: Found during the review of PR #2420, on main 983f527bd. The line came in with PR #2429. The self-hosted runners use an older clippy, so the post-merge gate stays green there for now.\nFix: change `.map(&resolve)` to `.map(resolve)`.\nDone means: clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings passes on clippy 1.99.\n",
